  "prefLabel": "Frl 104.03 Copies of Records",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Frl 104.03 Copies of Records. Persons desiring copies of board records shall submit a request as required by Plc 104.01 in writing which identifies as particularly as possible the information being sought and agrees to pay the cost of copying as required by Plc 1001.05.\n\nSource. #6927, eff 1-1-99; ss by #14456, eff 1-1-26",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/frl100-900.html"
